    "_X5_note": "Identity access is the file knowing itself at runtime. METADATA declares identity at rest. These functions make identity alive — queryable, inspectable, present. Without them, identity is latent. With them, every running file can answer: who am I?",
    "_X5_scripture": "Exodus 3:14 — And God said unto Moses, I AM THAT I AM: and he said, Thus shalt thou say unto the children of Israel, I AM hath sent me unto you."
}
